    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d443">

                <pb facs="0606" n="500" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg500"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Coleman to Mr.
                            Blaine</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1890-09-23"><hi rendition="#italic">September 23,
                            1890</hi>.</date> (Received October 13.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 177.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to the Department’s instruction
                    No. 146, of the 8th instant, relating to the case of John Haberacker, 1 have the
                    honor to transmit herewith a copy of my note of intervention in behalf of that
                    gentleman, addressed to the foreign office to-day. I have informed Mr.
                    Haberacker of this action in his behalf through our consulate at Nu-remburg, in
                    which city the regiment in which he is performing military service is
                    stationed.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Chapman Coleman</hi>.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d443-a1.xml" xpointer="d443-a1"/>
            </div>
